# Build artifacts — the single package rebuilds lib/ on demand via `pnpm build` (publish pipeline).
# Hand-written typert fixed artifacts live under packages/workflow/typert/ (version-controlled,
# NOT build-generated; tsdown does not regenerate them).
lib/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Sandbox scratch files — local-only workflow task dumps / test output, never commit.
a.json
test-output.txt
# Ad-hoc hand-off / decision scratch note kept at the repo root; real docs live under docs/.
test.md
# Sandbox design / proposal scratch files — never commit (project-side plans live in docs/openspec or PRs).
artifacts/
# Sandbox ad-hoc diagnostic / inspection scripts — never commit.
scripts/tmp-*

# Playwright e2e artifacts (traces / html report / screenshots / test-results).
# The e2e suite lives in e2e/** (sources ARE versioned); only its outputs are ignored.
e2e/.artifacts/